-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 17.12.98 (הסתדרות המורים), הפרשה לקופת גמל: the
-- agreement that carries out §10 of the collective agreement of 8.9.98 with
-- הסתדרות המורים (imported:
-- 1998-09-08_histadrut-hamorim_out-of-school-activity_livui-tiyulim-gmul) —
-- contributions to a provident fund from 1.1.98 on the salary components
-- and payments that are not pensionable — and the twin of the agreement the
-- same employers signed the same day with ארגון המורים
-- (l4/agreements/oz-latmura/1998-12-17_oz-latmura_provident-fund.l4,
-- imported).
--
-- WHERE THE WORDS ARE THE OZ AGREEMENT'S, THE RULE IS IMPORTED, NOT COPIED:
-- §§2–9 and the two letters print the same rules (the differences are
-- spelling, punctuation and the parties' names), so each is the Oz module's
-- rule under this agreement's name, its 5% and 5% held to the Oz rates.
-- WHERE THEY DIFFER IT IS ENCODED HERE: הסתדרות המורים chooses the fund and
-- is bound (§4); §10 sets aside "סעיף 5" — the retroactive contribution it
-- in fact sets aside — where the Oz agreement prints "סעיף 9"; the letters
-- come in the other order; and the fund the agreement carries out is §10 of
-- this union's agreement of 8.9.98.
--
-- The base agreement of 25.12.2008, §§29(ו) and 30(ט), and the agreement of
-- 17.9.2013, §6(י), put contributions of 5% and 5% "on the principles of
-- the agreement of 17.12.98" on payments they create; each imports this
-- file. It speaks to no pay item of l4/lib/vocabulary.l4 and is in no root.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `1998-09-08_histadrut-hamorim_out-of-school-activity_livui-tiyulim-gmul`
IMPORT `1998-12-17_oz-latmura_provident-fund`

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — הפרשה לקופת גמל, הסתדרות המורים (17.12.1998)`

-- The actions are the Oz agreement's (`1998 provident-fund agreement
-- action`): the same duties, here הסתדרות המורים's.

