    `a month carries provident-fund contributions under the 1998 agreement` `in a sabbatical` `teaching in fact`

@ref akn:art_2__para_c
`applying the Histadrut provident-fund agreement to the owners' teachers` MEANS `applying the provident-fund agreement to the owners' teachers`

