§§ `5 ההפרשה`

-- The opening and (א)–(ב): from 1.1.1998, 5% from the employer and 5% from
-- the employee every month, on the payments neither pensionable nor in
-- Dafna, save the tax gross-up, the imputed benefit and any reward for
-- out-of-school activity; none on the jubilee grant and the clothing
-- allowance of one on a budgetary pension — the Oz agreement's rules and
-- rates, held to them.
@ref akn:art_5 akn:art_5/p1 akn:art_5__para_a akn:art_5__para_b
`the employer's provident-fund contribution under the 1998 Histadrut agreement` MEANS 5%
`the employee's provident-fund deduction under the 1998 Histadrut agreement` MEANS 5%

`the 1998 Histadrut rates are the Oz rates` MEANS
        `the employer's provident-fund contribution under the 1998 Histadrut agreement` EQUALS `the employer's provident-fund contribution under the 1998 agreement`
    AND `the employee's provident-fund deduction under the 1998 Histadrut agreement` EQUALS `the employee's provident-fund deduction under the 1998 agreement`
#ASSERT `the 1998 Histadrut rates are the Oz rates`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      p IS A `payment the 1998 provident-fund agreement tells apart`
      k IS A `pension of the 1998 provident-fund agreement's teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1998 Histadrut provident-fund agreement contributes on` d p k IF
    `the 1998 provident-fund agreement contributes on` d p k

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      p IS A `payment the 1998 provident-fund agreement tells apart`
      k IS A `pension of the 1998 provident-fund agreement's teacher`
      amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `1998 provident-fund amounts`
DECIDE `the 1998 Histadrut provident-fund amounts on` d p k amount IS
    `the 1998 provident-fund amounts on` d p k amount

-- (ג)–(ו): the retroactive contribution in December 1998 after the fund is
-- chosen by 17.12.98; the monthly contribution and the Wage Protection Law
-- (outside the corpus); the sabbatical cases and the deduction on return —
-- the Oz agreement's rules; the fund is chosen here by הסתדרות המורים.
