    `the sabbatical teacher's share of the retroactive contribution` `reimbursed by the end of 5759`

§§ `6–9 זכויות העובד, כפל הפרשה, תקדים ומעבר להפרשות לפנסיה`

-- akn:art_9 The heading of §9, a number with no title.

-- §6: the sums gathered are the employee's; §7: never twice on one
-- component; §8: no precedent for other funds, severance, the hour value or
-- the pension; §9: a move to pension contributions, by the pension
-- agreements, within 0.8% (§10 of the agreement of 8.9.98, 0.8% in both
-- unions' agreements) — the Oz agreement's rules.
@ref akn:art_6 akn:art_6/p1
`the employee is entitled to all the sums gathered in the Histadrut fund` MEANS `the employee is entitled to all the sums gathered in the fund`

@ref akn:art_7 akn:art_7/p1
GIVEN `contributions are made on it not under this agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
      `would be brought in under §5` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1998 Histadrut provident-fund agreement contributes on the component` `contributions are made on it not under this agreement` `would be brought in under §5` IF
    `the 1998 provident-fund agreement contributes on the component` `contributions are made on it not under this agreement` `would be brought in under §5`

@ref akn:art_8 akn:art_8/p1
GIVEN p IS A `what §8 says the 1998 components do not thereby count for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1998 Histadrut provident-fund agreement on its own makes the components count for` p IF
    `the 1998 provident-fund agreement on its own makes the components count for` p

@ref akn:art_9__para_a akn:art_9__para_b akn:art_9__para_c
GIVEN `pension contributions made for the State's engineers on such components` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the pension agreements were made` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the cost as a share of the pension salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the pension agreements take the place of the 1998 Histadrut provident-fund agreement` `pension contributions made for the State's engineers on such components` `the pension agreements were made` `the cost as a share of the pension salary` IF
        `pension contributions made for the State's engineers on such components`
    AND `the pension agreements were made`
    AND `the cost as a share of the pension salary` AT MOST `the cost of the employer's provident-fund share under the 1998 Histadrut agreement`

#ASSERT `the cost of the employer's provident-fund share under the 1998 Histadrut agreement` EQUALS `the cost of the employer's provident-fund share under the 1998 Oz agreement`

§§ `10 גימלאים`

-- Notwithstanding §5 — the retroactive contribution, which this agreement
-- names where the Oz agreement prints "סעיף 9" — the teachers who retired
-- from 1.1.98 to 30.11.98 have no contribution: they are paid once the sum
-- of the employer's contributions for every month from 1.1.98 to their
-- retirement, from 1.2.99 and by 1.3.99 — the Oz agreement's rule.
@ref akn:art_10 akn:art_10/p1
GIVEN `retired on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a 1998 retiree is paid a one-time sum in place of contributions, under the Histadrut agreement` `retired on` IF
    `a 1998 retiree is paid a one-time sum in place of contributions` `retired on`

`the section §10 of the Histadrut provident-fund agreement sets aside` MEANS 5

GIVEN `the employer's monthly contributions until retirement` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1998 Histadrut retiree's one-time sum` `the employer's monthly contributions until retirement` IS
    `the 1998 retiree's one-time sum` `the employer's monthly contributions until retirement`

`paying the Histadrut retired teacher's one-time sum` MEANS `paying the retired teacher's one-time sum`

